---
description: STAF Playwright tests — BaseTest, TestBaseAPI, thin test methods
globs: STAF.Playwright.Tests/Tests/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tests

- UI: inherit `BaseTest`; use `Page` from base; call page methods only — **no** raw `Page.Locator` / `ClickAsync` in tests
- API: inherit `TestBaseAPI`; use `ApiClient` + `ReportResultAPI`
- Contract: inherit `OpenApiContractTestBase`; use `RunAllContractTestsAsync` / `AssertAllContractTestsPassed`
- Config: `ConfigManager.GetParameter(...)` — no hardcoded URLs
- Golden UI: `STAF.Playwright.Tests/Tests/Test1.cs` | API: `ApiTests.cs` | Contract: `ContractTests.cs`
